### Review Case Flag request

The following case flags have been requested on the case:

<ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet">
  {% for flag in flags %}
  <li class="govuk-!-font-size-19">{{flag}}</li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>

Review the <a href="/cases/case-details/PCS/PCS/{{caseReference}}#Case%20flags">case flag request</a>,
decide whether it should be approved or rejected, and record the decision. The task will close when the approval or
rejection event is completed.
